"completion_tokens":73,"prompt_tokens":6650}},{"content":"I’m only using my main number, 555-123-2002. I don’t have any other numbers on my account. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":7,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:39:56.296412","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":7,"usage":{"completion_tokens":35,"prompt_tokens":2632}},{"content":"Thank you for confirming. Let’s start by checking a few things on your phone to diagnose the MMS issue. Please follow these steps:\n\n1. Check your phone’s status bar (the area at the top of your screen) and let me know:\n   - Do you see any signal bars, or does it say “No Signal”?\n   - Is there an airplane icon (✈️) showing?\n   - Do you see “4G”, “5G”, or any network type indicator?\n\nThis information will help me determine if your phone has cellular service, which is required for MMS. Please let me know what you see.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":8,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:39:58.003459","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":8,"usage":{"completion_tokens":130,"prompt_tokens":6762}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":9,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:39:59.129331","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_UBuN5MyIbQsQjFlHynWgRPph","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":9,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2801}},{"content":"Status Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📵 Data Disabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":10,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:39:59.129711","tool_call_id":"call_UBuN5MyIbQsQjFlHynWgRPph","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":10,"usage":null},{"content":"At the top of my screen, I see full signal bars and it says “5G.” There’s no airplane icon showing. But I do notice something that says “Data Disabled.” Is that important?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":11,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:00.436618","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":11,"usage":{"completion_tokens":43,"prompt_tokens":2842}},{"content":"Yes, that is important. MMS (picture messages) require mobile data to be enabled, even if you have a strong signal and 5G service. \n\nPlease enable mobile data on your phone. You can usually do this by:\n- Swiping down from the top of your screen to open the quick settings menu.\n- Looking for an icon labeled “Mobile Data” or “Cellular Data.”\n- Tapping it to turn it ON.\n\nOnce you’ve enabled mobile data, try sending a picture message again. Let me know if it works or if you still have trouble.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":12,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:01.817133","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":12,"usage":{"completion_tokens":118,"prompt_tokens":6939}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:02.815624","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_XIgKxcrRg2f8Xr04Yzfxkklv","name":"toggle_data","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":13,"usage":{"completion_tokens":11,"prompt_tokens":3007}},{"content":"Mobile Data is now ON.\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:02.816061","tool_call_id":"call_XIgKxcrRg2f8Xr04Yzfxkklv","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":14,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:04.219385","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_FE5E4POwteE4HfdPbWWp79y3","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3052}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:04.219805","tool_call_id":"call_FE5E4POwteE4HfdPbWWp79y3","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":16,"usage":null},{"content":"I turned on the mobile data like you said, but I still can’t send picture messages. Is there something else I should try?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:05.601706","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":17,"usage":{"completion_tokens":29,"prompt_tokens":3080}},{"content":"Thank you for letting me know. Let’s continue troubleshooting. The next step is to check if your phone’s APN (Access Point Name) settings are correct, as incorrect APN settings can prevent MMS from working.\n\nCould you please check your APN settings on your phone and let me know if you see anything unusual, or if you’re not sure how to check, let me know and I’ll guide you through the process.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:07.158937","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":18,"usage":{"completion_tokens":89,"prompt_tokens":7090}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:08.451398","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_NK3skDEvrx0wAyj2wsaEEP4B","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3202}},{"content":"Current APN Name: internet\nMMSC URL (for picture messages): Not Set\n(These are technical settings, usually best left unchanged.)","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:08.451853","tool_call_id":"call_NK3skDEvrx0wAyj2wsaEEP4B","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":20,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked the APN settings, and it says the APN name is “internet,” but I don’t see anything listed for the MMSC URL. Is that a problem? I’m not really sure what any of this means.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:10.189072","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":49,"prompt_tokens":3251}},{"content":"Thank you for checking. Yes, not having an MMSC URL set is a common reason why MMS (picture messages) won’t work. \n\nHere’s what you should do next:\n1. Reset your APN settings to the default values. This will usually restore the correct MMSC URL.\n2. After resetting, restart (reboot) your phone for the changes to take effect.\n\nWould you like step-by-step instructions on how to reset your APN settings and reboot your phone?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:11.517191","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":22,"usage":{"completion_tokens":100,"prompt_tokens":7232}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":23,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:12.941529","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_7g0KJUpIr86aYclaZT8VBe7N","name":"reset_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":23,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3404}},{"content":"APN settings will reset at reboot.\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":24,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:12.941878","tool_call_id":"call_7g0KJUpIr86aYclaZT8VBe7N","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":24,"usage":null},{"content":"I’ve reset the APN settings like you suggested. I’m a bit nervous about restarting my phone—will I lose any of my photos or messages if I do that?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":25,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:14.753765","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":25,"usage":{"completion_tokens":37,"prompt_tokens":3455}},{"content":"You will not lose any of your photos, messages, or personal data by restarting (rebooting) your phone. Restarting simply turns your phone off and back on, which helps apply the new settings.\n\nPlease go ahead and restart your phone now. Once it’s back on, try sending a picture message again and let me know if it works.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:16.129110","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":26,"usage":{"completion_tokens":73,"prompt_tokens":7373}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":27,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:17.254836","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_gekXKWD96ixpwJJeP1r7SrTI","name":"reboot_device","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":27,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":3569}},{"content":"Resetting APN settings...\nRestarting network services...\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":28,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:17.255387","tool_call_id":"call_gekXKWD96ixpwJJeP1r7SrTI","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":28,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":29,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:18.383858","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_BrNy1DT81W6u2jKZD5Fo2HgY","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":29,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3621}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":30,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:18.384223","tool_call_id":"call_BrNy1DT81W6u2jKZD5Fo2HgY","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":30,"usage":null},{"content":"Okay, I restarted my phone like you said, but I still can’t send picture messages. This is getting a bit frustrating—why isn’t it working yet?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":31,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:20.018850","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":31,"usage":{"completion_tokens":35,"prompt_tokens":3649}},{"content":"Thank you for your patience, John. I understand this is frustrating, and I’m here to help you step-by-step until we resolve the issue.\n\nLet’s check a few more things that can affect MMS:\n\n1. Is Wi-Fi Calling enabled on your phone? Sometimes, having Wi-Fi Calling ON can interfere with sending MMS.\n2. Are you connected to Wi-Fi right now, or just using mobile data?\n\nPlease let me know, and I’ll guide you through the next steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":32,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:21.656737","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":32,"usage":{"completion_tokens":100,"prompt_tokens":7485}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":33,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:23.068828","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_afbjOQjUBfaywboC1JDNE7Ho","name":"check_wifi_calling_status","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"id":"call_STH5uo6SP2cS6Krr2P89Fzt8","name":"check_wifi_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":33,"usage":{"completion_tokens":44,"prompt_tokens":3788}},{"content":"Wi-Fi Calling is currently turned OFF.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":34,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:23.069254","tool_call_id":"call_afbjOQjUBfaywboC1JDNE7Ho","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":34,"usage":null},{"content":"Wi-Fi is turned OFF.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":35,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:23.069319","tool_call_id":"call_STH5uo6SP2cS6Krr2P89Fzt8","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":35,"usage":null},{"content":"Wi-Fi Calling is turned off on my phone, and I’m not connected to Wi-Fi—just using mobile data right now. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":36,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:24.582912","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":36,"usage":{"completion_tokens":34,"prompt_tokens":3842}},{"content":"Thank you for confirming that Wi-Fi Calling is off and you’re using mobile data. Let’s check if your messaging app has the necessary permissions to send MMS.\n\nCould you please check if your messaging app has permission to access storage and SMS? If you’re not sure how to check this, let me know and I can guide you through the steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":37,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:25.855864","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":37,"usage":{"completion_tokens":72,"prompt_tokens":7623}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":38,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:26.985201","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_RDQGewsD5781SQNrA5I3YVOy","name":"check_installed_apps","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":38,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3952}},{"content":"The following apps are installed on the phone: messaging, browser","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"